# Citation metadata, in Citation File Format 1.2.0.
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository".
#
# No release has been published and there is no DOI. `version` names the
# current unreleased version so a citation is unambiguous about what it saw.
#
# `license` is the code license. Datasets minted from this repository carry
# CC-BY-4.0, which is recorded in LICENSE-DATASETS.md and written into every
# manifest. The format has one license field, so this is the one it holds.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: 'Mintmark banking: synthetic Turkish retail banking records'
abstract: 'Declaration-and-data pack producing synthetic Turkish retail banking records: customers,
  accounts, cards, transactions, and the free-text surfaces where personal data hides. Span-labeled
  against a pinned eighteen-label taxonomy. Requires the Mintmark engine. Contains no real
  institution, brand, or person, and ingests no real data.'
type: dataset
version: 0.2.0
authors:
- family-names: Guner
  given-names: Fatih
  alias: fatihguner
repository-code: https://github.com/lokomotifai/mintmark-banking
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- synthetic data
- Turkish
- banking
- KVKK
- named entity recognition
- test data
